WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.314
Welcome to AI Innovators.

00:00:01.434 --> 00:00:03.076
High-school learners investigate real-world problems,

00:00:03.196 --> 00:00:04.838
evaluate evidence, examine ethical challenges,

00:00:04.958 --> 00:00:06.272
and design responsible solutions.

00:00:06.392 --> 00:00:09.019
Students prepare to use AI with creativity, integrity,

00:00:09.139 --> 00:00:10.125
and human judgment.
